## The first step

::bg{location="stair" time="night"}
::music{playback="start" mood="stair" volume="normal"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The first step is warm from the Hearth. The second is not. By the tenth she can see her breath.
@wren{code="0010" mono}: One at a time. Everyone says that like it helps.
@narrator{code="0020"}: Somewhere above, something with too many teeth notices her.
